A '''nonverbal spell''' is a [[spell]] that lacks a verbal [[component]], so it can be cast while [[silence]]d.

The nonverbal spells included in Neverwinter Nights are
''[[clarity]]'',
''[[ethereal visage]]'',
''[[lesser dispel]]'', and
''[[ray of enfeeblement]]''.

In addition, any spell cast with the [[silent spell]] (or [[automatic silent spell]]) feat is treated as a nonverbal spell.

